                                "sense_id": "e7d9a695-d063-378d-9953-334df5de6125",
                                "text": "Thus, as carnivorous vultures watch to englut their prey, the rapacious rebels enjoyed a savage delight in the hope of ensnaring him,[…]"
                            }
